response:
Sure! I would love to host a dinner party with the following historical figures:

1. Albert Einstein - his insights into the universe would be fascinating;
2. Queen Elizabeth II - her experience and wisdom as the Head of State of the United Kingdom would be invaluable; 
3. Nelson Mandela - his leadership during the struggle against apartheid and his dedication to peace would be inspiring;
4. Leonardo da Vinci - one of the most creative minds in human history;
5. Isaac Newton - a towering figure who revolutionized our understanding of physics and mathematics.

The conversation would be enlightening, as all these individuals have impacted the world in their unique ways.
